  m_Name: TurnBack
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Lattice.Data::Lattice.Data.QuestDef
  id: TurnBack
  title: A Route With Room To Turn Back
  description: Every road out runs through one passage. Stillwater's anchor is closing
    on it at Sorrel, over the nursery, and the whole convoy is going through together
    or not at all.
  steps:
