  flagsOnComplete: []
  stepText:
  - Hear the plan, and who is doing which part of it
  - Go back to the first moon
  - 'Open the four clamps on Mother of Doors: take the weight, wait for the slack'
  - Bring the convoy up to Last Mooring
  - Break the Tollkeeper's braces, and stop its gate motor on foot
  - Go up the Continuance's boarding spine
  - Put out the three shield projectors on the director's craft
  - Open the two arm couplings on her frame
  - Answer her in the control well
  - 'Take the last collar: one hold, on Idra''s call'
  - Run the passage with the convoy
  - Go back up the lane for the tug Welcome Back
  - Bring her through to the rendezvous
  - See the new neighbourhood, and then Orrin
  - Mend the handrail on the garden stair, and repaint the line
